B.PG={"i'm just browsing, thanks.":0,"i'm good for now, thanks.":1,"i'll let you know if i need anything.":2,"i'm just looking around, thanks.":3,"i'll ask if i need any help.":4,[u.f]:5,"i'll come back later, thanks.":6,"i'll think about it and come back.":7,"i'll take another look later.":8,"will do. thanks.":9,"sure, thank you.":10,"sounds good, thanks.":11,"could i get an iced latte, please?":12,"can i have an iced latte, please?":13,"i would like an iced latte, please.":14,"that's all, thank you.":15,"that will be all, thanks.":16,"i'm all set, thank you.":17,"can i help you find anything?":18,[u.I]:19,"hi, what can i get for you?":20,"anything else?":21}
